1. Each box in $\pi'$ is contained in some box of $\pi$;
2. $\pi'$ is a Henstock partition;
3. $\pi'$ is subordinate to $r$;
4. The union of $\pi'$ equals the union of $\pi$;
5. The distortion of $\pi'$ equals the distortion of $\pi$.

